  <!-- EN: dead sarlacc -->
  <DeadSarlacc.label>死沙拉克</DeadSarlacc.label>
  <!-- EN: The remnant of a dead sarlacc creature. Perhaps disease, starvation, predation from burrowing insects or maybe even old age has killed it leaving behind a cavern that it's body once filled. -->
  <DeadSarlacc.description>一只死去的沙拉克生物的残骸。也许是疾病、饥饿、穴居昆虫的捕食，甚至是年老体衰导致它死亡，只留下一个曾经填满它身体的洞穴。</DeadSarlacc.description>
  <!-- EN: Cannot collapse -->
  <DeadSarlacc.comps.CompSealable.cannotSealLabel>无法折叠</DeadSarlacc.comps.CompSealable.cannotSealLabel>
  <!-- EN: Collapsing the sarlacc cavity is permanent. Anything or anyone left below will be lost forever.{0}\n\nAre you sure you want to continue? -->
  <DeadSarlacc.comps.CompSealable.confirmSealText>坍塌沙拉克洞是永久性的。留在下面的任何东西或任何人都将永远消失。

你确定要继续吗？</DeadSarlacc.comps.CompSealable.confirmSealText>
  <!-- EN: Choose a colonist to permanently collapse the sarlacc cavity entrance. Anything or anyone left below will be lost forever. -->
  <DeadSarlacc.comps.CompSealable.sealCommandDesc>选择一名殖民者，永久性地坍塌沙拉克洞穴入口。留在下面的任何东西或任何人都将永远消失。</DeadSarlacc.comps.CompSealable.sealCommandDesc>
  <!-- EN: Collapse sarlacc cavity -->
  <DeadSarlacc.comps.CompSealable.sealCommandLabel>坍塌的沙拉克洞穴</DeadSarlacc.comps.CompSealable.sealCommandLabel>
  <!-- EN: Sarlacc Grave -->
  <DeadSarlacc.portal.enteredLetterLabel>萨拉克坟墓</DeadSarlacc.portal.enteredLetterLabel>
  <!-- EN: In the depths of a dead Sarlacc. Not much here but rocks and rubble and dead flesh. Quite the morbid tourist attraction! -->
  <DeadSarlacc.portal.enteredLetterText>在一个死去的 Sarlacc 的深处。这里除了岩石、瓦砾和死人肉外，没有其他东西。相当病态的旅游景点！</DeadSarlacc.portal.enteredLetterText>
  <!-- EN: sarlacc pit -->
  <SarlaccPit.label>沙拉克坑</SarlaccPit.label>
  <!-- EN: The gaping maw of a juvenile sarlacc creature. The endlessly hungry sarlacc can be used to quickly get rid of various organic corpses and so such sites are popular with various criminal enterprises. It will occasionally regurgitate a small amount indigestible scrap metal; no doubt leftover from some unlucky "prey". -->
  <SarlaccPit.description>幼年沙拉克生物的大嘴。饥饿无尽的沙拉克可以用来快速处理各种有机尸体，因此这类地点很受各种犯罪企业的欢迎。它偶尔会反刍出少量难以消化的废金属</SarlaccPit.description>
